{#
  The call to action — four fields, one component, used twice today.

  RATIONALE.md and BRIEF.md §2: never a coloured button, never a price alone. The
  product, the coverage, the duration and the price arrive together or not at all,
  because a price without its scope is the shape of a quote rather than a published
  rate. All four are read from products.json (§10), so a price change is one edit.
#}

{% macro cta(href, product) %}
<a class="cta" href="{{ href }}">
  <span class="f f--product">{{ product.name }}</span>
  <span class="f">{{ product.dimensions }} dimensions</span>
  <span class="f">{{ product.duration }}</span>
  <span class="f">{{ product | price }}</span>
</a>
{% endmacro %}
